WEBVTT

00:00:01.980 --> 00:00:07.950
It's time for the finals 
of the first-ever WRGP!

00:00:08.680 --> 00:00:12.420
It's real!  I can see it via Luca's mark!

00:00:12.420 --> 00:00:13.930
I'll tell you.

00:00:14.180 --> 00:00:17.280
That is Ark Cradle, god's castle.

00:00:17.690 --> 00:00:19.630
The land where Ileidos sleeps.

00:00:19.730 --> 00:00:21.360
Ark Cradle?

00:00:21.590 --> 00:00:25.590
When Team New World wins the WRGP,

00:00:25.590 --> 00:00:32.080
Ark Cradle will show its true self and 
land on the earth.  At that time...

00:00:32.290 --> 00:00:37.180
Neo Domino City will be destroyed, 
and the world will be reborn.

00:00:38.790 --> 00:00:40.480
This battle is mine!

00:00:40.650 --> 00:00:44.430
Red Nova Dragon attacks 
Meklord Emperor Skiel!

00:00:44.900 --> 00:00:48.030
Take this!  Burning Soul!

00:00:56.960 --> 00:00:58.490
It's over!

00:00:58.490 --> 00:01:04.260
Team 5D's first duelist Jack Atlas 
defeated Team New World's Lucciano!

00:01:04.260 --> 00:01:09.320
He won using his miraculous 
new power Red Nova Dragon!

00:01:09.850 --> 00:01:10.620
He did it!

00:01:10.620 --> 00:01:13.010
You're incredible, Jack!

00:01:13.110 --> 00:01:17.350
This is a great start, Jack!  Keep 
it up and defeat the second duelist!

00:01:17.960 --> 00:01:20.320
There's something strange about this duel.

00:01:21.230 --> 00:01:28.480
Jack's strategy was superior to Lucciano's, 
but they couldn't afford to lose this battle.

00:01:28.820 --> 00:01:31.420
Taking that into account, he lost too easily.

00:01:37.720 --> 00:01:40.480
That was a nice way to lose, Lucciano.

00:01:41.290 --> 00:01:42.570
Be quiet!

00:01:43.420 --> 00:01:48.620
Even though it's part of our 
strategy, that wasn't fun.

00:01:48.780 --> 00:01:50.480
But it's fine.

00:01:50.480 --> 00:01:55.340
They stepped into hell 
and can no longer escape.

00:01:55.350 --> 00:02:00.090
Yeah.  The countdown to 
their demise has begun.

00:02:06.700 --> 00:02:10.110
Team New World's second Wheeler is Placido!

00:02:10.110 --> 00:02:13.480
What strategy will he use?

00:02:14.350 --> 00:02:16.290
You've come, you worthless punk!

00:02:16.290 --> 00:02:19.950
I'll crush you, just like I did Lucciano!

00:02:20.230 --> 00:02:22.910
You talk big for a bug.

00:02:23.170 --> 00:02:25.070
I'll put you in your place!

00:02:26.230 --> 00:02:27.160
Duel!

00:02:29.700 --> 00:02:31.250
Riding Duels.

00:02:31.520 --> 00:02:34.380
These duels evolved in the world of speed.

00:02:34.650 --> 00:02:41.280
The people with the legendary marks who 
risked their lives were known as 5D's.

00:02:43.170 --> 00:02:48.980
Run!  The road of evolution 
leading to tomorrow

00:02:49.280 --> 00:02:53.350
Is a new legendary duel

00:03:05.860 --> 00:03:10.470
Throw away all feelings of failure

00:03:11.440 --> 00:03:16.110
Set free your infinite potential

00:03:16.440 --> 00:03:21.510
Every beginning is up to you

00:03:22.050 --> 00:03:28.020
Everyone is lost  Pursue the light

00:03:28.650 --> 00:03:33.390
Losing sight of fleeting dreams

00:03:33.960 --> 00:03:39.230
Connect the bond and you'll never lose

00:03:41.500 --> 00:03:47.040
Become the gale and dance  
Cut through the darkness

00:03:47.310 --> 00:03:52.410
Even if you can't see your destination

00:03:52.540 --> 00:03:57.920
Run on your feet without fear

00:03:58.150 --> 00:04:03.450
On this road that leads to tomorrow

00:04:03.890 --> 00:04:10.500
Going my way!!  Break through and go!

00:04:24.980 --> 00:04:30.620
Assault!!  Meklord Emperor Wisel

00:04:34.850 --> 00:04:39.020
He has Red Nova Dragon and 
one set card on his field.

00:04:39.780 --> 00:04:45.490
I have Infinite Prison, Infinite Aura and 
Lucciano's two set cards on my field.

00:04:45.880 --> 00:04:47.970
This is plenty.

00:04:48.280 --> 00:04:49.630
My turn!

00:04:51.300 --> 00:04:54.210
I summon Wise Core in defense position!

00:04:57.410 --> 00:04:59.670
He's planning to summon Meklord Emperor.

00:04:59.670 --> 00:05:00.370
Yeah.

00:05:09.560 --> 00:05:14.500
Why isn't he combining with his 
D-Wheel?  That's his true form.

00:05:15.670 --> 00:05:19.060
I activate Speed Spell - Lightning Rod!

00:05:19.060 --> 00:05:24.660
When I have 2 or more Speed Counters, 
I can destroy one monster on my field!

00:05:29.190 --> 00:05:34.170
When a card effect destroys Wise Core, I 
can Special Summon Meklord Emperor Wisel...

00:05:34.590 --> 00:05:35.400
...Wisel Top...

00:05:36.380 --> 00:05:37.620
...Wisel Attack...

00:05:38.580 --> 00:05:39.820
...Wisel Guard...

00:05:40.800 --> 00:05:42.990
...and Wisel Carrier!

00:05:43.330 --> 00:05:45.970
Combine, Meklord Emperor Wisel!

00:06:07.090 --> 00:06:09.040
Here I go, Jack Atlas!

00:06:09.710 --> 00:06:12.680
I activate Meklord Emperor Wisel's effect!

00:06:12.780 --> 00:06:18.080
Once per turn, it absorbs one 
Synchro Monster on your field!

00:06:20.110 --> 00:06:23.120
You still don't understand?  
Your Synchro-sealing strategy

00:06:23.120 --> 00:06:25.660
doesn't work against Red Nova Dragon!

00:06:25.660 --> 00:06:28.130
I activate Red Nova Dragon's effect!

00:06:28.130 --> 00:06:32.420
By removing it from play, one 
of your monsters can't attack!

00:06:35.220 --> 00:06:37.110
All right!  He avoided it!

00:06:37.110 --> 00:06:39.970
And Meklord Emperor can no longer attack!

00:06:40.170 --> 00:06:44.740
It'll always end the same way!  You can 
never use the same strategy against Jack Atlas!

00:06:44.950 --> 00:06:47.000
That's my line.

00:06:47.280 --> 00:06:50.040
Did you think the same strategy 
would work against me?

00:06:50.040 --> 00:06:50.950
What?

00:06:51.200 --> 00:06:53.790
I activate the trap Infinity Barrage!

00:06:54.960 --> 00:06:57.770
That's the card I set for you, Jose!

00:06:57.770 --> 00:07:00.530
It's not for Placido to use!

00:07:01.050 --> 00:07:03.600
Why doesn't he follow the strategy?

00:07:03.600 --> 00:07:06.730
Is he planning to defeat them on his own?

00:07:08.180 --> 00:07:09.220
That guy!

00:07:10.480 --> 00:07:13.020
Sorry, but I'm going to run wild.

00:07:13.810 --> 00:07:18.480
When you have no monsters, 
if I choose not to attack,

00:07:18.480 --> 00:07:22.150
you take 400 points of 
damage for every monster!

00:07:22.390 --> 00:07:26.650
Meklord Emperor is treated as one monster, 
but it's actually five monsters.

00:07:27.090 --> 00:07:30.790
In other words, you take five monsters' 
worth of damage for 2000 points!

00:07:31.000 --> 00:07:34.130
What?  2000 points of effect damage?

00:07:35.040 --> 00:07:38.840
He knew absorbing a Synchro 
Monster wouldn't work,

00:07:38.840 --> 00:07:43.100
but he did it to remove Red Nova Dragon 
from play and leave Jack's field wide open!

00:07:43.420 --> 00:07:46.120
It all led to this trap card!

00:07:50.080 --> 00:07:51.030
Jack!

00:07:51.300 --> 00:07:54.010
I set two cards and end my turn.

00:07:54.290 --> 00:07:56.040
Yusei is my only opponent.

00:07:56.470 --> 00:07:59.480
I don't need to use my 
true power against you!

00:07:59.650 --> 00:08:01.760
Then I'll force you to get serious!

00:08:01.760 --> 00:08:06.190
I'll show you that you can't 
survive against Red Nova Dragon!

00:08:06.820 --> 00:08:12.490
Red Nova Dragon was removed from play, but 
it returns to the field during the End Phase!

00:08:15.560 --> 00:08:17.060
My turn!

00:08:18.670 --> 00:08:22.150
Red Nova Dragon attacks 
Meklord Emperor Wisel!

00:08:22.560 --> 00:08:24.680
Burning Soul!

00:08:28.800 --> 00:08:32.910
But I now activate Wisel Guard's effect!

00:08:33.280 --> 00:08:36.680
Your monster's attack target 
switches to this card.

00:08:37.610 --> 00:08:39.620
Do you really think you dodged it?

00:08:39.770 --> 00:08:43.360
I knew you would use Wisel Guard's effect!

00:08:43.720 --> 00:08:46.520
I activate the Continuous 
Trap Burning Strike!

00:08:48.060 --> 00:08:50.410
When my monster gains its effect and attacks

00:08:50.410 --> 00:08:53.470
a monster in defense position, 
it deals piercing damage!

00:08:53.820 --> 00:08:56.180
What?  Piercing damage?

00:08:56.590 --> 00:09:02.480
Red Nova Dragon has 5500 attack points 
and Wisel Guard has 1200 defense points.

00:09:03.050 --> 00:09:07.670
That means he deals 4300 points 
of piercing damage!  Jack wins!

00:09:07.670 --> 00:09:10.000
Go, Red Nova Dragon!  Burning Soul!

00:09:12.830 --> 00:09:17.380
That's not good enough!  I 
activate the trap Wise G3.

00:09:18.200 --> 00:09:23.070
By sending Wisel Guard on 
my field to the graveyard,

00:09:23.380 --> 00:09:27.010
I can Special Summon Wisel 
Guard 3 from my hand.

00:09:28.550 --> 00:09:32.410
Due to its effect, the attack 
target switches to Wisel Guard 3.

00:09:32.720 --> 00:09:37.100
And this card can't be destroyed 
in battle once per turn!

00:09:39.990 --> 00:09:42.300
But you still take piercing damage!

00:09:46.410 --> 00:09:49.660
He was so close to winning!

00:09:49.660 --> 00:09:53.100
The Continuous Trap Infinite Aura activates.

00:09:54.520 --> 00:09:58.130
For every 100 points of damage, 
it gains one Aura Counter.

00:09:59.910 --> 00:10:03.000
Then I activate the trap Echo Mirror!

00:10:03.280 --> 00:10:05.310
He's doing it again!

00:10:05.310 --> 00:10:11.060
When a monster in defense position isn't 
destroyed in battle, I draw one card from my deck.

00:10:11.060 --> 00:10:17.410
If I draw a monster card, you take 
300 points of damage per Level!

00:10:18.930 --> 00:10:22.920
I drew the Level 3 monster Wisel Attack 3!

00:10:23.070 --> 00:10:25.700
You take 900 points of damage!

00:10:29.020 --> 00:10:30.000
Jack!

00:10:31.160 --> 00:10:34.260
I set one card and end my turn!

00:10:35.760 --> 00:10:38.240
What a fierce battle!

00:10:38.240 --> 00:10:40.510
Neither side is giving an inch!

00:10:43.870 --> 00:10:46.390
I slightly underestimated him.

00:10:46.920 --> 00:10:50.930
But 500 life points is more 
than enough to defeat him!

00:10:51.590 --> 00:10:54.960
Are you going to let him 
do whatever he wants?

00:10:58.980 --> 00:11:01.680
Placido, playtime is over!

00:11:01.680 --> 00:11:02.390
What?

00:11:02.940 --> 00:11:05.520
Did you forget our mission?

00:11:08.700 --> 00:11:12.540
Fine.  I'll follow the plan.

00:11:12.960 --> 00:11:14.220
My turn!

00:11:15.910 --> 00:11:18.720
I set two cards and end my turn.

00:11:19.020 --> 00:11:20.970
What?  You're ending your turn?

00:11:21.200 --> 00:11:26.820
Whoa!  Placido ends his turn 
after only setting two cards!

00:11:26.820 --> 00:11:28.320
What's going on?

00:11:28.590 --> 00:11:31.030
He didn't attack.

00:11:32.150 --> 00:11:37.510
Something's wrong.  What's 
Team New World planning?

00:11:54.380 --> 00:11:55.740
What's going on?

00:11:56.040 --> 00:11:58.860
He ended his turn after 
only setting two cards?

00:11:59.020 --> 00:12:01.450
What's wrong, Jack Atlas?

00:12:01.450 --> 00:12:03.410
There's no need to show mercy.  Attack me!

00:12:06.740 --> 00:12:09.140
What are they planning?

00:12:12.860 --> 00:12:16.040
Infinite Aura.  That card is...

00:12:17.930 --> 00:12:24.110
Every time I take damage, the Continuous 
Trap Infinite Aura records that pain!

00:12:24.700 --> 00:12:25.860
Can it be?

00:12:26.240 --> 00:12:28.160
Lua, get the pit board!

00:12:28.160 --> 00:12:29.140
Okay!

00:12:34.350 --> 00:12:35.450
I see.

00:12:36.860 --> 00:12:39.150
That card is the key.

00:12:39.960 --> 00:12:41.290
My turn!

00:12:43.130 --> 00:12:45.040
I set one card.

00:12:45.410 --> 00:12:47.910
I activate the trap Synchro Sonic!

00:12:48.510 --> 00:12:52.470
For every Synchro Monster on my field,

00:12:52.460 --> 00:12:57.330
I destroy one faceup card in 
your Spell & Trap Card Zone.

00:12:57.510 --> 00:12:59.580
I destroy Infinite Aura!

00:13:01.170 --> 00:13:03.120
Oh no!  They figured it out!

00:13:03.120 --> 00:13:04.590
I won't let you do that!

00:13:05.030 --> 00:13:08.710
I activate the trap Infinity Guard Formation.

00:13:08.930 --> 00:13:14.560
By negating my monster's effect this turn, 
it prevents my card from being destroyed!

00:13:19.180 --> 00:13:23.780
He separated Meklord Emperor 
in order to protect his card!

00:13:24.080 --> 00:13:26.380
That card is definitely their secret plan!

00:13:27.290 --> 00:13:29.260
But I'll eliminate you first!

00:13:29.750 --> 00:13:33.720
When Meklord Emperor separates, it's a 
regular monster with 0 attack points!

00:13:34.330 --> 00:13:38.200
Red Nova Dragon attacks 
Meklord Emperor Wisel!

00:13:38.790 --> 00:13:40.950
Burning Soul!

00:13:49.830 --> 00:13:53.620
The Continuous Trap Infinite 
Aura's effect activates!

00:13:53.620 --> 00:13:57.980
For every 100 points of damage, 
it gains an Aura Counter.

00:13:58.560 --> 00:14:02.360
Then I activate the Continuous 
Trap Infinite Prison's effect.

00:14:02.760 --> 00:14:04.490
By discarding one card from my hand,

00:14:04.790 --> 00:14:09.450
I treat one monster card in my 
graveyard as a spell card and set it.

00:14:09.890 --> 00:14:11.430
He did it!

00:14:11.430 --> 00:14:16.760
After Lucciano, Jack Atlas defeated Placido!

00:14:16.760 --> 00:14:18.330
Well done, Jack!

00:14:18.860 --> 00:14:21.130
He did it!  He defeated two of them!

00:14:23.970 --> 00:14:28.820
What are you doing?  Infinite 
Aura was almost destroyed!

00:14:29.370 --> 00:14:34.220
So what?  I did what I had 
to do, so stop complaining.

00:14:34.220 --> 00:14:35.650
Complain?

00:14:35.650 --> 00:14:39.870
Stop it, you two.  We shouldn't 
fight amongst ourselves.

00:14:39.870 --> 00:14:41.320
But Placido was...

00:14:41.420 --> 00:14:43.480
Leave the rest to me.

00:14:43.480 --> 00:14:46.780
Infinite Aura has 80 Counters, 
just as we planned.

00:14:47.170 --> 00:14:52.460
It's finally time to defeat 
them and complete the Circuit.

00:14:55.470 --> 00:15:00.520
Just wait, Yusei Fudo.  I have 
a chance to battle you again.

00:15:04.990 --> 00:15:08.260
What's so special about that card?

00:15:10.020 --> 00:15:12.970
It's the finale of the first-ever WRGP!

00:15:12.970 --> 00:15:17.440
The baton is passed to Jose, 
Team New World's last Wheeler!

00:15:22.430 --> 00:15:24.790
What's going on?

00:15:24.790 --> 00:15:29.000
The last Wheeler Jose is running on his own!

00:15:29.000 --> 00:15:30.370
What is he doing?

00:15:30.370 --> 00:15:32.270
Isn't he going to ride a D-Wheel?

00:15:33.200 --> 00:15:34.710
What is he planning to do?

00:15:44.680 --> 00:15:47.730
Team 5D's, prepare yourselves.

00:15:47.730 --> 00:15:49.720
The real battle begins now!

00:15:50.120 --> 00:15:52.700
I'll show you our power!

00:16:05.670 --> 00:16:06.880
What?

00:16:07.200 --> 00:16:08.340
He combined?

00:16:08.600 --> 00:16:11.320
What's happening?

00:16:11.320 --> 00:16:15.310
The D-Wheeler combined with his D-Wheel!

00:16:15.310 --> 00:16:18.050
This is the D-Wheel's final form!

00:16:18.050 --> 00:16:23.350
The duelist is betting his soul 
on Team New World's victory!

00:16:23.350 --> 00:16:25.390
This is their true form.

00:16:27.030 --> 00:16:29.240
They're finally getting serious.

00:16:34.640 --> 00:16:39.130
Here I go, Jack Atlas!  I'll bury you first!

00:16:39.470 --> 00:16:44.740
Go ahead and try!  Jack Atlas 
won't lose against you!

00:16:45.740 --> 00:16:46.700
Duel!

00:16:51.090 --> 00:16:55.250
What?  We'll now take real damage!

00:16:56.730 --> 00:16:58.390
My turn!

00:16:59.790 --> 00:17:02.660
I summon Grand Core in defense position!

00:17:04.660 --> 00:17:08.090
Then I activate the trap Explosive Blast!

00:17:08.090 --> 00:17:15.210
I can destroy up to three Machine-Type 
monsters on my field that haven't battled this turn.

00:17:14.550 --> 00:17:20.820
For every monster destroyed by this 
effect, you take 400 points of damage!

00:17:25.170 --> 00:17:26.030
Jack!

00:17:26.870 --> 00:17:29.670
I activate Grand Core's effect!

00:17:29.990 --> 00:17:36.440
When a card effect destroys this card, I can 
Special Summon Meklord Emperor Granel...

00:17:36.920 --> 00:17:38.140
...Granel Top...

00:17:38.140 --> 00:17:39.830
...Granel Attack...

00:17:39.830 --> 00:17:41.530
...Granel Guard...

00:17:41.530 --> 00:17:44.240
...and Granel Carrier from my deck or hand!

00:17:44.240 --> 00:17:47.740
Combine, Meklord Emperor Granel!

00:18:13.640 --> 00:18:18.630
Team New World summoned 
their third Meklord Emperor!

00:18:19.140 --> 00:18:22.610
I activate Meklord Emperor Granel's effect!

00:18:22.820 --> 00:18:28.200
Its attack and defense points 
become the same as my life points.

00:18:30.210 --> 00:18:31.980
4000 attack points!

00:18:31.980 --> 00:18:35.250
But Red Nova Dragon has 5500 attack points!

00:18:35.250 --> 00:18:40.000
Those attack points can't 
stop my Burning Soul!

00:18:41.200 --> 00:18:44.280
You're very confident in your attack points.

00:18:44.280 --> 00:18:48.010
I'll start by breaking your confidence.

00:18:48.460 --> 00:18:51.940
I activate Speed Spell - Takeover.

00:18:55.620 --> 00:18:59.490
When I have 4 or more Speed Counters, 
I can destroy Infinite Aura

00:18:59.490 --> 00:19:04.750
to gain life points equal to the 
number of Counters multiplied by 100.

00:19:05.720 --> 00:19:07.330
100 times?

00:19:07.330 --> 00:19:08.450
That much?

00:19:08.750 --> 00:19:14.780
Infinite Aura has 80 Counters.  Therefore, 
I regain 100 times that for 8000 points.

00:19:16.820 --> 00:19:20.430
I have 12000 life points!

00:19:20.690 --> 00:19:23.590
Due to Meklord Emperor Granel's effect,

00:19:23.590 --> 00:19:28.280
its attack and defense points 
become the same as my life points!

00:19:30.630 --> 00:19:33.110
12000 attack points!

00:19:33.640 --> 00:19:37.910
I see!  Their goal was to gather 
Counters on Infinite Aura

00:19:37.910 --> 00:19:41.590
and use them to gain life points, 
attack points and defense points!

00:19:41.590 --> 00:19:43.200
That means...

00:19:43.200 --> 00:19:46.060
The other two lost on purpose?

00:19:46.060 --> 00:19:48.980
You've figured it out too late!

00:19:51.050 --> 00:19:54.500
The final chapter in completing 
the Circuit begins!

00:19:54.820 --> 00:20:01.990
Witness our power!  Meklord Emperor 
Granel attacks Red Nova Dragon!

00:20:03.470 --> 00:20:04.410
Jack!

00:20:04.410 --> 00:20:06.890
Red Nova Dragon's effect activates!

00:20:07.170 --> 00:20:11.350
Red Nova Dragon is removed from play until 
the End Phase, and you can't attack!

00:20:11.470 --> 00:20:15.320
I won't let it escape!  Granel 
Top's effect activates!

00:20:17.570 --> 00:20:24.020
When Granel attacks, your Synchro 
Monster's effect is negated.

00:20:24.310 --> 00:20:27.520
What?  Negate a monster's effect?

00:20:30.410 --> 00:20:32.940
Grand Slaughter Cannon!

00:20:38.640 --> 00:20:40.490
Red Nova Dragon!

00:20:47.490 --> 00:20:50.520
Jack!

00:20:50.520 --> 00:20:51.460
Master Atlas!

00:20:51.460 --> 00:20:55.430
Then Granel Attack's effect activates!

00:20:55.750 --> 00:20:59.910
It absorbs the Synchro Monster 
that was destroyed in battle!

00:21:09.650 --> 00:21:12.270
Meklord Emperor Granel gains attack points

00:21:12.270 --> 00:21:17.340
equal to the absorbed Synchro 
Monster's original attack points!

00:21:20.690 --> 00:21:24.100
No monster can oppose it!

00:21:24.410 --> 00:21:26.520
Victory is ours!

00:21:26.520 --> 00:21:29.280
The world will be reborn!

00:21:29.760 --> 00:21:32.530
15500 attack points...

00:21:33.520 --> 00:21:34.750
You must be kidding.

00:21:35.030 --> 00:21:38.290
There's no way we can defeat that monster!

00:21:38.910 --> 00:21:41.580
So this is Meklord Emperor Granel!

00:22:06.340 --> 00:22:11.580
If the world is endless, prove it to my heart

00:22:11.680 --> 00:22:16.910
If we shed the same tears, 
let's laugh together

00:22:17.050 --> 00:22:22.290
Freed reality forms phrases 
in the piercing beat

00:22:22.420 --> 00:22:25.020
Our hearts resonate

00:22:25.020 --> 00:22:30.260
As the nameless flower blooms with sound

00:22:30.400 --> 00:22:36.900
We'll find a place for us

00:22:38.800 --> 00:22:43.680
Waking in a dream  Stretch 
our hands toward the future

00:22:43.680 --> 00:22:48.710
Grab and release repeatedly as we search

00:22:49.450 --> 00:22:54.890
Repaint the darkness with 
the colors we envision

00:22:54.890 --> 00:23:03.460
Overlaying memories, bonds 
and hope creates future color

00:23:03.460 --> 00:23:09.070
We will draw it forever
